Pre-Chorus]\n是不是每一个人\n都在假装完整\n笑着说“我没事”\n却早就裂痕\n\n[Chorus]\n所有人都在 和自己的无价值对抗！\n在现实洪流里 拼命不被遗忘\n眼泪落下瞬间 也是一种反抗\n哪怕世界冰冷 我也要滚烫\n\n所有人都在 和命运反复碰撞\n一次次跌倒 也要重新登场\n如果未来太远 看不见方向\n那就先把此刻点亮\n\n[Bridge]\n别再说你不配发光\n别再把自己隐藏\n那些破碎的地方\n正是光照进的方向\n\n就算渺小又怎样——！\n也值得被这个世界照亮——！\n\n[Final Chorus]\n所有人都在 和自己的无价值对抗！\n这一生不过是在学会原谅\n破碎又怎样 那是光的形状！\n越是黑暗越要拼命发光\n\n所有人都在 和命运温柔对抗\n带着满身伤痕 也依然滚烫\n不需要谁来证明你的重量\n你本身 就是光\n\n[Outro]\n别再对抗\n试着原谅\n你就是光"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "歌词,或者简单描述歌曲内容", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [1115.2506103515625, 51.96287155151367], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 36, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["\n\nRH获取音频有时候有问题，有1S或者二首歌同样的情况，贞贞网站左侧-异步任务，找到任务ID，点击打开可以看到里面的内容，搜索mp3，有2首歌下载链接\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [411, 173], "pos": [1410.113525390625, 66.4962158203125], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_ad